+  /*!
+   * \brief Hades: a display was connected to an output of the device in use, and the display watch
+   *        takes it while Kodi runs (CDRMDisplayWatch::LiveMover, HowToTake()): MoveOutputTo(), on
+   *        the thread that draws, under the conditions of a change of the Monitor setting (the
+   *        output carries the interface alone, the display of Kodi is awake, no video plays; music
+   *        only where the user said to move), and only where a start would take that very output
